THIRD-PARTY NOTICES AND ATTRIBUTIONS

LULCkit incorporates or downloads third-party software and pretrained model weights:

1. Dynamic World PyTorch Port (`src/lulckit/models/s2_dw.py`)
   - Adapted from `calebrob6/dynamic_world_pytorch` (Apache License 2.0)
   - Based on Google Dynamic World v1 (Brown et al., 2022, Scientific Data,
     https://github.com/google/dynamicworld, CC-BY 4.0 / Apache-2.0)

2. Hugging Face SegFormer Land Cover Models (`src/lulckit/models/hf_segformer.py`)
   - `nave1616/SegFormer-landcover-FT` (OpenEarthMap taxonomy)
   - `florian-morel22/segformer-b0-deepglobe-land-cover` (DeepGlobe taxonomy)
   - Checkpoints are downloaded from Hugging Face Hub on first use; verify model
     cards on https://huggingface.co for dataset and checkpoint terms.

3. Interactive Web Map Renderer (`src/lulckit/cartography.py`)
   - Generated HTML maps load MapLibre GL JS (BSD-3-Clause) via unpkg CDN
     and optionally stream public basemap tiles (Carto, OpenStreetMap, Esri).
